OL,4,CSex abuse teacher arrested for missing 
OL,5,Csentencing                             
OL,6,GPolice have arrested a teacher         
OL,7,Gconvicted of sexually abusing two      
OL,8,Gpupils at an all-boys school in the    
OL,9,Glate 1980s after she failed to turn up 
OL,10,Gfor her sentencing hearing.            
OL,12,FSally-Anne Bowen, who taught chemistry 
OL,13,Fat Christ's College in Finchley, north 
OL,14,FLondon, was in her 20s when she had    
OL,15,Fsex with one pupil up to 30 times and  
OL,16,Fkissed a second boy while the pupils   
OL,17,Fwere aged about 14 or 15.              
OL,19,FHer trial heard she wore short tight   
OL,20,Fskirts and flirted in class, with one  
OL,21,Fformer pupil comparing her behaviour   
OL,22,Fto "a Sabrina Carpenter video".        
